From 1dd4b9acd84045c230e77cc68d85eafca58eae88 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hao Lin <hao.lin@samsung.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 20:46:50 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] [llvm-profgen] Add quality reports and failure contracts for
 IP samples

Report raw per-event and selected-event counts, identity evidence, ISA,
coverage and visible LOST diagnostics without conflating event units.
Use exact optional thresholds and deterministic JSON with explicit unknowns.

Validate output aliases before side effects and atomically replace reports
before committing the profile. Preserve an old profile on every failure.
Cover shared library exits with a single-shot stage-aware callback while
leaving the unregistered LBR path unchanged.

Exercise real damaged ELF and truncated DWARF inputs, plus hidden injections
at actual failure sites, to check cleanup and existing-output preservation.
